OL,3,GNEWSAReferee, 15, fears abuse will
OL,4,Adrive others away
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 15-year-old football referee has said
OL,7,Fabuse from parents and coaches could
OL,8,Fdiscourage other young people from
OL,9,Ftaking up officiating.
OL,11,FToby, who referees Dale Park Rangers
OL,12,FUnder-11s matches in Winterton, North
OL,13,FLincolnshire, said he had been shouted
OL,14,Fat and criticised by adults over
OL,15,Fdecisions made during games.
OL,17,F"I don't feel like there's enough
OL,18,Freferees because of the abuse they get
OL,19,Ffrom parents and coaches," he said.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
